# Period 1: Q defines wells at nodes 8, 14 and 33; MULT (AUXMULTNAME) is 1 there.
# Period 2: only MULT, at the same cells: Q keeps its values.
# Period 3: MULT also at node 20: the records are nodes 8, 14, 20 and 33 and Q keeps its
# values record by record (MF6's input memory), so node 20 gets -40 and node 33 zero.
# Period 4: empty block, no wells.
